wins recorded against A Hindell in this tournament, which was a single-cycle
12-player all-play-all, so one of them must have been against another opponent.
I'm pretty sure the other Pratten-Hindell game is the correct one as it is
clearly marked in the newspaper which provides the score, drawing attention to
Pratten's youth. So this one is probably wrong. Perhaps it is one of Pratten's
wins against Miss Adams (Portobello) or JW Thomas (Orpington) - JS} 1-0

